# The docker build context carries the sources only: THE Dockerfile builds
# from a clean checkout — the deps stage installs the frozen bun.lock tree
# itself, the builder compiles every dist target and runs the deterministic
# checks, and the runtime copies only the lean output. The local
# node_modules trees, the built dist, the committed distpackage staging
# (the builder stages its own), the release scratch, the mobile capacitor
# shell (a native wrapper concern, never a container input), the packaged
# archives and the development state never enter the image.
.git
.github
.manus-logs
node_modules
web/node_modules
mobile
dist
distpackage
build
web/dist
release
staging
*.tgz
*.zip
*.xpi
*.vsix
*.tar.gz
*.log
*.sqlite
*.db
.env
